WEBVTT

00:38:59.044 --> 00:39:03.695
that it's this thing that is really
sucking down the lower middle class.

00:39:03.719 --> 00:39:05.415
CA: Put these together a bit more,

00:39:05.439 --> 00:39:09.997
because there's quite a wide feeling
right now that politics is broken.

00:39:10.021 --> 00:39:15.019
To some extent, capitalism seems broken.

00:39:15.043 --> 00:39:18.927
Lots of jobs get lost, lots of inequality.

00:39:18.951 --> 00:39:21.313
There's just a lot of unease

00:39:21.337 --> 00:39:26.348
with the comfortable sense
of 20, 30 years ago of,

00:39:26.372 --> 00:39:32.616
"Oh, end of history.
We figured out how to run societies."